{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is close, take it and process. If not visible, approach. Scan area otherwise. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
